Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Yamoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's a Thule over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thule is coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex Raptor, you never had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.75,0:01:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were going to\Nsummon Serpent Night Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I had my mesmeric control card\Nready to send your dragon to Dreamland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know what\Ncard I was going to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, that's simple. I'm psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now finish him off, Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with your psychic wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon's demolished!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex Raptor got creamed big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because his opponent has ESP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I didn't believe the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:02:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he predicted all of my moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.15,0:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got another prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll hand me your locator\Ncard and your rarest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, promise you'll take good care of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your serpent night dragon doesn't\Ndeserve a slot in my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suppose it'll make a\Ndecent coaster for my drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of you commoners\Ncan I embarrass next?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I left my deck at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't duel because my\Nduel disc's on the fritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.31,0:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They all know my psychic rep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Except that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.27,0:02:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna duel? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my advice and stay\Naway from this freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Esperoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He duels using ESP.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he's psycho?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll mind-read the cards in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll know what move\Nyou'll make before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.93,0:02:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:03:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He beat you using mind control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.27,0:03:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but I smoked you at Duelist\NKingdom, and I dueled by my own rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule number one in the\NJoey Wheeler rulebook is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,never back down from any challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, always seek opponents\Nwith crazy dueling techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll take on this cosmic clown,\Neven though he's psycho. Psychic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.11,0:03:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll eat you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The runner-up in the\NDuelist Kingdom tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be honored to try out my\Ndueling skills against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess my reputation precedes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, your reputation is a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.49,0:03:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn you, Peabrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, I mean Tristan. Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I brought you a little entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A yo-yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's a laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might be going nuts up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.53,0:04:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kaiba Corporation is streaming the\NBattle City tournament live on the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd watch\NJoey's next duel together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Tristan, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll watch the duel and I'll provide\Nyou with the exciting play-by-play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.27,0:04:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey will be so psyched that\Nwe're keeping tabs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One duel simulcast coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how\Nto turn this thing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the duel started yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's day two of the tournament\Nand I still haven't seen Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who should I duel next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to choose my\Nnext opponent wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler's dueling some dude with ESP.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This I gotta see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get the stakes straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting up my rare\Nand powerful Jinzo card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But since I've already foreseen your\Ndefeat, I'll be taking your time, wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.71,0:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Roba?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby, if I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I found the Battle City site.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll search for Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And voila, here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see how Joey's doing so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're about to\Nstart and it's Joey's turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,For my first move, I'll place this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Celestial force, I call upon you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me one with the psychic\Nuniverse. Show Joey's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.49,0:06:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,thoughts to me And every\Ncard in his pathetic hand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The extrasensory forces of\Nthe universe flow through me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your strategies are helpless\Nagainst my all-knowing power
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this new-age nitwit\Nbabbling about, Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nom, nom, nom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You are toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here's another prediction, Rob.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna mop the floor with you. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty of the Dark Knight! Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to think of a different move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Joey should do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.51,0:06:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I summon that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.57,0:06:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see it in the stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the rule book.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey must have broken\None of Kaiba's new rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've dueled before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't ESP, Bonehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You played an illegal card. I did? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City's new rules say\Nyou can't summon a monster that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful unless you sacrifice\Na lower-level monster first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get with the program, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And you a runner-up at Duelist\NKingdom? Ha! What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough out\Nof the peanut gallery, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I predicted you were dumb, but who\Nknew you were that much of a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself, you\Nmind-reading freak show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just giving you a head\Nstart, so I don't beat you too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosmic energies come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the celestial forces and the\Nuniversal vibe of psychic truth tell
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, that the top card in your hand\Nis the Swordsman of Landstar. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he really have psychic powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen this trick before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just jealous of\Nmy telepathic powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My ability to tap into\Nthe cosmic universe is too
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,complicated for your\Npeanut-sized brain to comprehend,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:07:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ticking me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll summon Cyber Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you have no monsters on the field,\NI can directly attack your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.09,0:08:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't my day so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose to this misfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Raider got you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you ready for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's getting whipped by this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If he loses this duel,\Nhe's out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be giving\Nme the play-by-play, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong? Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that this duel's\Nbeen so totally one-sided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a snooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that means my brother\Nis winning, right? Um, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:09:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, he was the\Nrunner-up at Duelist Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and this time he's going\Nstraight to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me a liar, Joey. I predict\Nthat you're finished. You wish, Roba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.23,0:09:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Joey I know you\Ncan beat this guy on your own
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling this so-called psychic\Nduelist isn't all he claims to be Let's tell
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Esper what else this\Nguy's got I'm pretty sure
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that I see Graceful Dice\Nunder his swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful Dice is under his swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I predict you're ready to quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess again, Roba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know you're up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:10:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He just drew another Graceful\NDice. Okay, bro. Now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your opponent just picked\Nup another Graceful Dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this stuff again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You just drew yet another graceful\Ndice card, am I right, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's about to lose his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This little scheme may have gotten\Nthem this far in the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know Joey will defeat these cheats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No one expects you to keep up with\Nmy unique telepathic dueling powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I foresee that your Battle\NCity days are over and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,that your rarest card will\Nbe sitting in my deck soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all in the stars, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.21,0:10:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Bluehair's definitely up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he knew I'd picked\Nup a second graceful
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,dice card from the deck\Nand he was almost right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time for me to play some\Nmind games of my own with this cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Swordsman of Landstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll place two cards\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing he placed both\NGraceful Dice cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How predictable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful Dice allows\NWheeler to roll one die
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to boost the power of one of his monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Its attack points are then\Nmultiplied by the number rolled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're planning to activate\Nboth of your Graceful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dice cards as soon as\Nmy Cyberator attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And multiply your Swordsman\Nof Landstar's attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.93,0:11:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll be even more esteemed when\NI prove what a fraud you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great plan, except\Nthat it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The new rules say you can only play\None Graceful Dice card at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my power psyched you out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sacrifice Cyber Raider and\Nsummon the fiend Mega Cyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,His Fiend Mega-Cyber's\Nattack strength is 2,200.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,More than four times the\Nstrength of my monster's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the die comes up\Nfive or higher, I'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, five or six.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes your monster's attack\Nstrength a measly 1,500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,which means my monster\Nwon't even break a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiend, Mega Cyber, bring him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, slow down, Roba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget my other face-down card?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just get through\Ntelling you, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only use one\NGraceful Dice card per turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said it was a Graceful Dice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A Skull Dice Trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cheat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Skull dice reduces your monster's attack\Nstrength depending on the roll of the die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The higher the number, the more\Nyour monster's points are reduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that your monster's\Nbasically a wimp, swordsman, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your psychic\Nfriends dropped the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I only had one graceful dice card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been getting some bad\Ninformation, and now I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of how I held my cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you knew I had two dice cards,\Nbut you couldn't tell which ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means your ESP game was just a con.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't see my cards at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll bet you got friends in high\Nplaces who can, you snake in the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Violation! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze! Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.69,0:14:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother will never\Nduel in this town again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We've learned our lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you've got to\Ngive him another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Battle City Tournament Commissioner,\Nit's my swarm duty to bust cheaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one good reason why\NI shouldn't cancel this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some mercy, Commish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Our brother isn't doing\Nthis for the dueling glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're carnival folk, or\Nat least we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we left the show, he's\Nkept the bullies off our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big brother protects\Nyou from bullies?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me of when\NI was a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:14:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, does the baby need a diaper? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys try picking on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,See, every day after school, the\Nbig kids would gang up on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But even bullies respect a\Ngood duelist like our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he wins, they leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just trying to make sure he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have seen everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let you guys off the hook, what's to\Nstop you from pulling this stunt again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let my brother duel or\Nwe're toast after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give him a chance to go legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Espa may be a bogus psychic,\Nbut he's a great duelist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem sincere. I bet Yu-Gi\Nwould give him a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If he cheats again, then it's no more Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice Guy. Thanks, Kamish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother stories get me every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Yugi all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu said he had to enter this tournament\Nto save the world from an ancient evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knows when that evil will show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know for sure is that when it\Ndoes, we'll all be there to stand by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you accusing me of faking\Nall my psychic abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, make sure that you read\Nthe cards right, you fools. Too bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm getting a telepathic vision
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,right now that's just\Nguaranteed to come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you're a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who's a fraud when I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you, you lose in disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream on, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without my psychic\Nabilities, I've never lost a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can tell that's not going to\Nchange any time in the near future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:16:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Esper, I don't have psychic powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do have a belief in myself that\Na chump like you'd never understand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Very poetic. But you'll\Nneed more than a belief to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,stop me from blasting you\Nright out of the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey I'm tired of yapping\Nabout the future Let's finish
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,this duel here and now I predict\Na nasty end for you, Wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,without Yugi to help you You couldn't\Nduel your way out of a paper bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to taste the psychic power\Nof my dueling deck, you amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Psycho Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.53,0:17:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down\Non the field and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got no monster on\Nthe field to hide behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can attack him head on,\Njust like he attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a good card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.85,0:18:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see him wrestle this gator.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll summon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.55,0:18:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator's sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My two monsters have a total\Nattack strength of 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,60 more than his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Esper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a vision of the\Nfuture, and you're not in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doomed once my alligator's\Nsword is done with your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Serenity, one more move\Nand Joey will win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.33,0:18:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, fake brawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.15,0:18:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up your defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Swordsman of Landstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish off this fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm letting you\Nattack me twice, you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I'm going to activate\Nthe trap card, Mind Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:18:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, this can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.51,0:19:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a monster falls into my mind trap, it\Ninstantly becomes my brainwashed servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.35,0:19:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't Esper spring the trap\Ncard during my first attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If Esper had sprung mind control\Nwhen Alligator Sword attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,he could have used the brainwashed gator\Nto attack Joey Swordsman of Landstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but he waited to use\Nit on Joey's Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.25,0:19:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason he'd wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to sacrifice my Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,For when he does, I'll be ready for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face\Ndown and end my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.43,0:19:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sacrifice your Swordsman of\NLandstar and I'll summon Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.03,0:19:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.73,0:20:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chrome Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a trap card ready\Nand waiting for you. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hope your\Nface-down card isn't a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if it is, my next\Nmove may disappoint you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your stuff, Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! My trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With Jinzo on the field, all\Nyour trap cards are useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I foresee the finish. With no defenses,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo will destroy you in no time at all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll be out of\Nthe tournament for good,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.61,0:20:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him win!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alone.
